      "description": "Seria: a subtle text face with striking details.\n\nSeria® was released in 2000. It can be seen as a 'literary' typeface, with long ascenders & descenders and a distinctive upright italic. Its relatively small x-height makes Seria a rewarding challenge for the experienced typographer.\n\nIn 2003, the Seria family won two awards: a Certificate of Excellence from the ISTD and a Certificate of Excellence in Type Design.",
